{"unit_id":"xCube007__dsh-message-rewind#card-zh","repo":"xCube007/dsh-message-rewind","commit":"0d4046e7417b69325e43d50c09eda86db64d622c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-message-rewind 是 DeepSeek Harness 网页端插件，在用户消息气泡下提供编辑、删除和复制操作，并通过主机接口截断后续对话。编辑后会从修改内容重新发送，删除则移除该消息及后续轮次；两种操作都可选择把已记录的文本文件改动恢复到消息之前。适合需要修正提示或撤回对话、并管理关联文件状态的 DSH 用户。需要 Node.js 20+ 和兼容版本的 DSH，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:326-335","client.js:657-675","index.js:205-246","files.js:85-113","package.json:43-45"]}
{"unit_id":"xCube007__dsh-message-rewind#card-en","repo":"xCube007/dsh-message-rewind","commit":"0d4046e7417b69325e43d50c09eda86db64d622c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-message-rewind is a DSH web plugin for editing or deleting your sent messages. Editing resends corrected text from that point; deletion removes later turns. Either action can optionally restore recorded text-file changes. It requires Node.js 20+ and a compatible DSH version, with no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:326-335","client.js:657-675","index.js:205-246","files.js:85-113","package.json:43-45"]}
