{"unit_id":"xCube007__dsh-message-rewind#feature-1","repo":"xCube007/dsh-message-rewind","commit":"0d4046e7417b69325e43d50c09eda86db64d622c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-message-rewind 的功能「编辑并重发」：在自己的消息旁打开编辑框，修改纯文本后保存；插件截断该消息之后的轮次，并把新内容作为后续对话重新发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:657-675","index.js:212-240"]}
