{"unit_id":"xCube007__dsh-message-rewind#caveat-1","repo":"xCube007/dsh-message-rewind","commit":"0d4046e7417b69325e43d50c09eda86db64d622c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-message-rewind 使用前须知：含附件的消息不能编辑，且文件回滚依赖可用的记录快照，仅支持文本文件；没有工作区或快照不完整时只能回滚消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:212-213","index.js:221-229","files.js:22-40"]}
